  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>It is easy for the kami to take notice of your actions when your soul glows like a lighthouse in the midst of a fog.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Onmyōji level 10th, petition spirits class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose an ability granted by the spirit pool class feature, such as iron talismans. Whenever you use that ability, you gain 1 temporary spirit point. This temporary spirit point lasts until the end of your turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
